			"Message": "docs(Sky): Update InstallTests JSDoc now that ITestService is exposed\n\n`Source/Function/Sky/Bridge/InstallTests.ts` previously documented that `ITestService` was absent from `globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__`. The workbench accessor plugin now exposes `TestService` via `Output/Source/Service/CEL/Expose/Accessor.ts`, so the module-level doc comment is updated to reflect the current state and clarify that services are invoked directly when available.\n\nAlso normalizes an em-dash to an en-dash in the service-missing log message for consistency with surrounding convention.",
			"SHA": "42318a959d1fefdbe269b9aed5470ead692b7661"
